## Опытные образцы
dh-prototype-examine = [color=orange]Experimental prototype.[/color] May fail. Field use: {$uses}, failures: {$failures}. Scan a tested prototype in a chem-material scanner to put the design into series production.
dh-prototype-examine-jammed = [color=red]It is jammed.[/color] Use it in hand to clear the jam.
dh-prototype-jam = The prototype jams!
dh-prototype-jammed = It's jammed — clear it first.
dh-prototype-unjam = You clear the jam.
dh-prototype-tool-fail = The prototype sparks and fails!
dh-prototype-machine-fail = {CAPITALIZE(THE($machine))} sparks and shuts down — the experimental board failed!
dh-prototype-report-name = prototype test report ({$item})
dh-prototype-report-header = Prototype test report: {$item}
dh-prototype-report-stats = Field use: {$uses}. Failures: {$failures}.
dh-prototype-report-refined = Test data accepted. The design is now in series production — new prints will be reliable.
dh-prototype-report-untested = Not enough test data: use the prototype in the field (at least 3 times) or bring it back after a failure.
dh-prototype-report-already-serial = The design is already in series production.
